#### Phase 3: Grafana Dashboard Creation (Week 3-4)

**Step 6: Create SLO Overview Dashboard**

Build Grafana dashboard displaying current SLA compliance status, error budget consumption, and trends.

**Dashboard Structure** (JSON export excerpt):

```json
{
  "dashboard": {
    "title": "Claims API - SLA Monitoring Dashboard",
    "tags": ["sla", "slo", "claims-api"],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "panels": [
      {
        "title": "Current Month Uptime vs SLO Target",
        "type": "stat",
        "targets": [{
          "expr": "sli:availability:ratio_30d{service=\"claims-api\"} * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Current Uptime %"
        }],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {"value": 0, "color": "red"},      // <99.5% = SLA breach
                {"value": 99.5, "color": "yellow"}, // 99.5-99.7% = between SLA and SLO
                {"value": 99.7, "color": "green"}   // >99.7% = exceeding SLO
              ]
            },
            "mappings": [],
            "unit": "percent",
            "decimals": 2
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "graphMode": "none",
          "colorMode": "background",
          "text": {
            "titleSize": 20,
            "valueSize": 60
          },
          "textMode": "value_and_name"
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Error Budget Remaining (Monthly)",
        "type": "gauge",
        "targets": [{
          "expr": "((216 - ((1 - sli:availability:ratio_30d{service=\"claims-api\"}) * 30 * 24 * 60)) / 216) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Error Budget Remaining %"
        }],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "thresholds": {
              "mode": "absolute",
              "steps": [
                {"value": 0, "color": "red"},      // 0-10% = Critical
                {"value": 10, "color": "orange"},  // 10-25% = Warning
                {"value": 25, "color": "yellow"},  // 25-50% = Caution
                {"value": 50, "color": "green"}    // >50% = Healthy
              ]
            },
            "unit": "percent",
            "min": 0,
            "max": 100
          }
        },
        "options": {
          "showThresholdLabels": true,
          "showThresholdMarkers": true
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Monthly Uptime Trend (Last 90 Days)",
        "type": "graph",
        "targets": [{
          "expr": "sli:availability:ratio_30d{service=\"claims-api\"} * 100",
          "legendFormat": "30-Day Rolling Uptime"
        }],
        "yaxes": [{
          "format": "percent",
          "min": 98,
          "max": 100
        }],
        "thresholds": [
          {"value": 99.5, "colorMode": "critical", "fill": false, "line": true, "op": "lt"},
          {"value": 99.7, "colorMode": "warning", "fill": false, "line": true, "op": "lt"}
        ]
      },
      {
        "title": "Latency Compliance (24-Hour Rolling)",
        "type": "stat",
        "targets": [{
          "expr": "sli:latency_compliance:ratio_24h{service=\"claims-api\"} * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Requests Meeting 2s Target"
        }],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "thresholds": {
              "steps": [
                {"value": 0, "color": "red"},
                {"value": 95, "color": "yellow"},  // SLA threshold
                {"value": 97, "color": "green"}    // SLO threshold
              ]
            },
            "unit": "percent",
            "decimals": 1
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "title": "Incident Timeline (Current Month)",
        "type": "annotations",
        "datasource": "PagerDuty",
        "targets": [{
          "query": "service:claims-api urgency:high"
        }]
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

**Step 7: Configure Dashboard Alerts and Annotations**

Add visual incident markers and alert thresholds to dashboards for context.

```yaml
# Grafana Dashboard Annotations (grafana-annotations.yaml)
annotations:

  - name: "SLA Breaches"
    datasource: "Prometheus"
    expr: 'ALERTS{alertname="SLABreach",service="claims-api"}'
    tagKeys: "severity,root_cause"
    titleFormat: "SLA Breach: {{root_cause}}"
    textFormat: "{{description}}"
    iconColor: "red"

  - name: "Incidents"
    datasource: "PagerDuty"
    serviceId: "P1234567"  # Claims API service ID
    includeResolved: true
    urgency: ["high", "low"]
    iconColor: "orange"
```
